
"""
""" ::: Vifm | Keybindings :::
"""

""" Toggle a preview window in the adjacient pane
nmap ,g :view<CR>

""" Create a new tab
nmap ,t :tabnew<CR>

""" Sync panes
nmap ,s :sync<CR>

""" Rename entries
noremap <silent> ,r :rename<CR>

""" Switch to normal view
nmap <c-v>r :regular<cr>

""" Switch to tree view
nmap <c-v>t :tree<cr>

""" Toggle normal-tree view
nmap <c-v>g :tree!<cr>

